      "writtenOn": "2023-05-26T09:53:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question: The network is null for the tethering and Wi-Fi P2P interfaces. Since these are all Wi-Fi related networks, should we also hold a lock for these interfaces?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 325,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 325,
